OL,3,GNEWSAMan to stand trial over assault at
OL,4,Acare facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied allegations of assault
OL,7,Fat a residential facility for young
OL,8,Fpeople with special educational needs.
OL,10,FOlawale Ishola, 36, pleaded not guilty
OL,11,Fto assault by beating at Acacia Hall in
OL,12,FFriesthorpe, near Market Rasen.
OL,14,FA further charge of common assault was
OL,15,Fdismissed when he appeared at Lincoln
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court earlier, and Ishola
OL,17,Fhas been released on conditional bail.
OL,19,FHe is due to appear at the same court
OL,20,Ffor a trial starting on 19 November.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
